{"1747470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Road Diner Simulator", "steam_appid": 1747470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a simple cook and rise to a diner owner. Build meaningful connections through the food you serve and turn them into a thriving business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook. Serve. Connect. Manage. Expand. Decorate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/8490db9c0a1676a14038aee339f3c936.avif?t=1786086409\" width=1232 height=208 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/e611cdb44e9e578b91519f6e3210485a.poster.avif?t=1786086409\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/e611cdb44e9e578b91519f6e3210485a.webm?t=1786086409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/e611cdb44e9e578b91519f6e3210485a.mp4?t=1786086409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Your customers come first.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seat guests, take orders, cook and serve dishes, clean tables. Keep the service smooth and efficient during the shift. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook from dozens of recipes, from scrambled eggs and juicy burgers to fried specialties. Test your skills and let guests judge your food. If they love it, they’ll return. If not… they won’t be shy about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/c9c24e7ba35c39a496b3885a8e7c3891.avif?t=1786086409\" width=1232 height=208 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/a78dd0801498d82a56d521b3c7cf3635.poster.avif?t=1786086409\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/a78dd0801498d82a56d521b3c7cf3635.webm?t=1786086409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/a78dd0801498d82a56d521b3c7cf3635.mp4?t=1786086409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><strong>A diner doesn’t run on good food alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees, assign tasks, and keep operations running smoothly, especially when the place is packed. Every staff member has a unique skill set, so putting the right person in the right position is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/dca5c1db2e20f9974b61c704432d4a5f.avif?t=1786086409\" width=1232 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/7af40e5e3194292e3c32f46f8db8c264.poster.avif?t=1786086409\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/7af40e5e3194292e3c32f46f8db8c264.webm?t=1786086409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/7af40e5e3194292e3c32f46f8db8c264.mp4?t=1786086409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Grow your diner at your own pace.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different building sizes and layouts to match your ambitions. Decide how much traffic you’re ready to handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new recipes, invest in additional cooking stations, and gain access to upgraded equipment and services. Expansion brings new possibilities and new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/4c4a25cba788d05fd68b64a89dd10422.avif?t=1786086409\" width=1232 height=208 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/976e115377b5402fba8f35f5730bda26.poster.avif?t=1786086409\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/976e115377b5402fba8f35f5730bda26.webm?t=1786086409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747470/extras/976e115377b5402fba8f35f5730bda26.mp4?t=1786086409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a space that reflects your vision.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design the interior, arrange tables, decorate walls and floors, and define the atmosphere. The Diner is your space to express yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The style is yours to choose!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a simple cook and rise to a diner owner. Build meaningful connections through the food you serve and turn them into a thriving business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook. Serve. Connect. Manage. Expand. Decorate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"b